Package: ailogR
Title: Quick Logging of AI Use in Research Projects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Caleb", "Robbins", email = "YOUR-EMAIL@baylor.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Logs AI use in research one task at a time, as rows in a
    plain CSV file. Logging asks a few questions and offers the last tool
    and research stage as defaults. Each entry records whether an error in the AI output would be
    obvious, caught by routine checks, or could pass silently into results,
    which sets how much detail it needs. AI tools can draft entries for a
    person to review. From the log, the package checks for gaps and drafts an
    AI-use statement.
